  "title": "Bacon-Wrapped Chicken Tenders",
  "description": "Baked turkey bacon-wrapped chicken tenders seasoned with smoked paprika are the perfect balance of smoky and sweet--they taste like they came straight off a barbecue grill.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
